flowchart TD
  O[Open wallet + Tracking ID on screen] --> OTP[Mobile OTP 2FA]
  OTP --> C[Consents]
  C --> ID[Identity Table-A plus EMI section 12]
  ID --> DUP{CNIC already has wallet?}
  DUP -->|yes| LOGIN[Login existing]
  DUP -->|no| PHOTO[Live photo]
  PHOTO --> SCR[Sanctions PEP]
  SCR -->|hit| REJ[Reject written]
  SCR -->|clear| V[NADRA Verisys]
  V --> A50[WALLET_ACTIVE VERISYS 50k]
  A50 --> BV[NADRA BV]
  BV --> A400[limit_tier BV 400k commercial]
  A400 --> ENH[Enhanced SoF SIM TMS]
  ENH --> A1M[limit_tier ENHANCED up to 1M]
